can play tunes, keeping your mind intact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deteriorating Environment:</strong><br>Time is a critical factor. As you stay in the shelter, your supplies and energy will dwindle. You must constantly adapt and make smart choices to stay alive.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
